WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:05.170
Alomagedon is no more!

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:09.460
Angels and demons divide heaven and earth.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:13.220
You shall be cursed for all eternity!

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.910
Derodero derosaimu!

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.070
Aloma!

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.690
No way...

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.540
Farewell.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:25.710
A-Aloma!

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:30.880
What's got her in such a huffy puffy mood-pri?!

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:37.550
She made this okonomiyaki for you, Mikan-chan.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.430
Okonomiyaki?

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:40.810
Ack!

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:49.070
Aloma did her best to grill this okonomiyaki since you were that hungry!

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.210
That's right!

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.650
Back then...

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:55.110
<i>Guess I'll have to.</i>

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:59.530
<i>I shall procure the corpse of a swine wrapped in white skin for thee.</i>

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>Thanks for getting a pork bun!</i>

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.350
<i>Wait there, I'll be back momentarily.</i>

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.820
For Mikan's sake, Aloma...

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:12.760
Mikan was so hungry she couldn't resist.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:18.280
In any case, Aloma's upset because you ate the cake SoLaMi Smile made!

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:19.860
That's not it!

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:24.130
You see, Mikan-chan made that cake for Aloma-chan.

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:24.850
Huh?

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.920
Aloma, Mikan's sorry-nano.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.780
Aloma... sorry-nano!

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:35.240
It was delicious.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:38.140
Since Aloma saw the preparations for her surprise party,

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:41.200
we couldn't tell her the truth-pri.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.280
So that's what happened.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.610
Thanks for the food.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:51.840
Aloma grilled Mikan such a delicious okonomiyaki.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:53.930
Mikan needs to tell Aloma she's sorry.

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:59.550
And in order to do that, she must find the pages that went flying off earlier!

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.540
Gel!

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:03.330
Wa-
Capisce!

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:05.020
Wait up!

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:39.940
June 6th, Idol Breakup!

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:45.210
It's not here-usa.

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.770
I rushed over after hearing what happened-kuma.

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:49.570
But we haven't found anything yet-kuma.

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:51.490
Any luck over there-kuma?

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:52.700
Nope.

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.630
Where did they fly off to?

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:58.320
Thanks for all your help-nano!

00:03:58.320 --> 00:03:59.340
It's a given.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.610
Besides, if Alomagedon breaks up now,

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:05.020
Dressing Parfedon, the name we came up with, won't become a reality.

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.860
I'll definitely find it!

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:08.020
You know that's a lie.

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:11.180
You're helping them because you're worried.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.100
Thanks.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.570
Don't worry.

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:16.930
I'm sure we'll find it!

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:18.020
Sophie-chan...

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:21.780
Everyone knows that those pages...

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:22.990
...are very precious to you.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:24.950
They are.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:33.460
That picture is our promise to become Divine Idols together when we were younger!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:39.140
Without it, Alomagedon might really be done for.

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:40.170
Girls!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.760
Let's do everything we can to find it!

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.080
Of course!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.060
All right, let's get searching!

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:50.170
Let's go!

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.900
We can't find it!

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:59.140
It's pointless to look around aimlessly-pri.

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.720
By taking into consideration the gust of wind from back then,

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:03.900
the rate of descent,

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:08.490
and by calculating the drag of a piece of paper,
I can narrow down the list of possible locations-pri!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.740
That's our Mirelle for ya!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.080
All right, I've got it-pri!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.790
It could be anywhere in PriPara-pri.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.310
Attention idols,

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:23.260
PriPara will be closing shortly.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:26.220
PriPara Town is quite big-kuma.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.220
You're asking the impossible-usa.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:31.050
We haven't found it after searching this long...

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:34.060
We'll have to search all of PriPara on our hands and knees-pri.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:38.940
Hm?

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.190
Ah! There it is!

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:42.460
Huh?

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:54.250
Mikan-chan!

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.210
Got it-nano!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.170
Wow! You did it!

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:02.130
But the other half...

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:04.780
It's dangerous to be in the lake,

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:06.920
so please do not enter.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.840
Oh, sorry-nano.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.500
Girls, it's already time to leave.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.530
Please make your way home straight away.

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:16.170
This was the system speaking!

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:27.240
Kurosu-san!

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.270
Hey, get down from there!

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:32.350
It's dangerous up there!

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:33.700
Hey, Kurosu-san!

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:35.640
Get down here!

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.160
Listen!

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.370
The time hath come!

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:44.500
Angels and demons shall divide heaven and earth.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:49.630
Let blood be bathed in blood as the flames of war are ignited.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.850
Earth has only one path left to it.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.820
A path to destruction!

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:57.700
Eh...?

00:06:57.700 --> 00:06:59.060
Aloma!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:01.180
Mikan's sorry-nano!

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:03.770
Mikan wants to talk with you!

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:08.900
You see, Mikan really, really, really loves you!

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:13.120
The sun has set, and it shall never shine again!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.980
It was all Mikan's fault!

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:17.080
She's really sorry-nano!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.790
A demon's rage shall last for all eternity!

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.680
Lightning, flash! Tempest, howl!

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:28.830
Punish the angel's sins for all eternity!

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:31.480
It's clearing up.

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:32.180
It is.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:35.260
Wait up, Aloma!

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.320
Listen to what Mikan has to say-nano!

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:38.780
I have no reason to speak to thee.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:40.780
If thine plan is to make merry with SoLaMi Smile without me-

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.700
You've got it all wrong-nano!

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:45.850
I can't hear thee.
That cake was for you!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:47.690
Gel.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.340
Ge...

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:52.860
Aloma!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:53.550
Hmph!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.330
Aloma!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.620
Please listen to the angel's request-nano!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.070
Shut it!

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:03.290
Thou are nothing but an audacious angel!

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.490
Wait-nano!

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:04.900
Please-nano!

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:06.200
Leave me alone!

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.380
Mikan-chan!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:13.430
Mikan has thought it over and has stopped eating so much.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:17.320
So Mikan is out of energy because she's hungry.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:24.850
It seems words aren't enough to get through to Aloma.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.880
Tada!

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.790
That's a delicious-looking sponge cake you baked there-nekon.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.180
It smells angelic...

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:53.670
You're drooling-nekon.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.020
This is for Aloma-nano!

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:58.360
But it still smells delicious!

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:01.130
Look at this and return to your senses-nekon.

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:01.980
No! Mikan can't!

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:03.910
Eating it is strictly off the table!

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:08.760
By sincerely remaking it, Mikan will present Aloma with the best birthday cake ever!

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:10.160
That's the spirit-nekon!

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:11.780
You can do it-nekon!

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:18.740
Hey, Aloma.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.090
What is it? I have no use for thee any more!

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:21.700
I'm hanging up.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.200
Hold it-nekon!

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:27.170
There are proper steps to take if you really want to disband Alomagedon.

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:29.630
Steps?

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.890
Still can't find it-kuma?

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:42.260
Well, I also lost something around here about six months ago,

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.140
and I still haven't found it-kuma.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:46.990
Oh... They're not listening, huh-kuma?

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:49.410
Anyway, I hope you find it soon-kuma.

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:53.110
And if you do, Alomagedon might be willing to team up with you-kuma.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:57.780
Making sure they make up is more important than forming a team.

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:58.570
Yeah.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:03.540
We've been searching for so long, and we still haven't found it.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.050
Ack!

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:12.380
Hold it right there-pri!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:13.360
What are you eating-pri?!

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.210
Out with it! Out with it-pri!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.800
Lala, shove your hand down its throat and get it back!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:19.810
Capisce!

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:20.770
Wait...

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:21.890
Really?!

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.480
Hurry up-pri!

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:25.730
Capisce...

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:27.890
Here goes nothing!

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.710
Search everywhere-pri!

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:33.820
Capisce!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.120
It's out-kuma!
It's out.

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:35.780
Kuma?

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:37.740
That's...

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:41.100
...the PR pic I lost six months ago-kuma!

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:42.580
You found it for me-kuma!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:45.290
Not even worth looking at-pri.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.510
Let's just put it back-pri.

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:49.920
Ah! You're horrible-kuma!

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:53.500
Where could it be?

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.620
Pri...

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.550
Pushuu~.

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:57.840
Oh!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:01.850
The butterfly's fluttering about.

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:05.230
We don't have time to be so easygoing-pri.

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:10.440
Wow, that's a really big butterfly.

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:13.400
Butterfly?

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:18.530
Mikan won't eat it this time!

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:25.400
<i>This twisted shape is just too much.</i>

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:29.660
<i>Not good, all this cream is trying to seduce Mikan-nano!</i>

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.300
<i>Eat it all.</i>

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:33.170
<i>If thou eat it, thou will feel better.</i>

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.800
The devil's temptation at a time like this-nano?

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.090
<i>Now eat it!</i>

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:38.360
No! Don't give in!

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:40.420
Angels are supposed to be infallible!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.800
Mikan's an angel-nano!

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:43.840
This cake's for Aloma!

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:47.260
This cake's for Aloma-nano!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.130
Save me!

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:52.780
A goat?!

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:54.030
Hey, let her go!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:56.190
Why, you!

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:58.860
Something came out.

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.420
A piece of paper?

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:05.280
Could it be the drawing?

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:10.700
Oh, you're earlier than I expected-nekon.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:14.180
I want to get the disbanding over and done with.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.720
I like Sanddab more than disband-nekon.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:18.680
Huh?!

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:22.360
As part of the process, please take a look at this-nekon.

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.220
Hooray! It's done!

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.780
Time to ea...

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:34.350
No! You can't!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.650
This is an important cake-nano!

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:39.080
Don't eat it-gel!

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.540
What is she doing?

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:42.440
That's your cake, Aloma-nekon.

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:44.800
Did you forget-nekon?

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:47.160
Today is your birthday-nekon.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:50.840
She was trying to make that cake yesterday,

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:53.610
and then Lala and Sophie came-nekon.

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:56.500
They want to form a Dream Team together.

00:12:57.090 --> 00:12:58.620
SoLaMi Smile did?

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:01.460
So they offered to help make your cake.

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:04.840
But then, you see, Mikan ate it.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:05.430
Gel...!

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:08.620
This is for Aloma-nano!

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:11.890
Aloma, Mikan is sorry-nano!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.270
Oh! Aloma!

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:22.480
You came-nano?!

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:28.460
Happy birthday, Aloma!

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:36.080
This is your surprise cake-nano!

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:40.540
All of this caused such a big misunderstanding.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.880
Mikan is really sorry-nano.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:48.400
You know how you're always bringing Mikan delicious food?

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:52.510
Well, Mikan wanted to make this delicious cake to say thanks.

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:57.850
Even the okonomiyaki you made yesterday was really good.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.470
Thou actually ate it?

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:02.580
How foolish!

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:06.450
I can't believe thee ate it after eating that much cake!

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:09.910
Of course! I wouldn't leave even a crumb.

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:13.740
Thou really... ate it?

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:18.800
From now on Mikan will only eat whatever you bring her!

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:21.370
Gelrun!

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:25.010
I-It's okay... to eat what others bring.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:28.920
After all, I can't always be with thee.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:31.880
I'm sorry for acting so childish.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:34.570
Aloma, thank you-nano!

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:37.620
The food I get from you is always the most delicious.

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:39.260
I get it! I get it!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:42.730
I'll curse thee for all eternity for saying such a thing!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.230
C'mon...

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:45.460
Curse...

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.190
You mean you like her-pri.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.940
Our friendship is eternal!

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:51.000
Gelrun!

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:51.910
Devi!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:54.620
We also have a present for you.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.950
Here's the other half of the drawing.

00:14:58.950 --> 00:15:00.250
Eh?!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.210
You found it?!

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:07.460
What we thought to be a really big butterfly actually turned out to be the drawing.

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:08.770
Hold on a moment!

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:09.420
Huh?

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:13.450
Then just what is this drawing that we picked up?

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:16.580
We screwed up!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.140
I'm not screwed up!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.070
Here.

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:23.670
Everything's been patched up!

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:24.860
Pri!

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.940
It looks like SoLaMi Smile took this one.

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:33.950
T-Thanks, everyone.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.660
The demon showed gratitude!

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:40.390
Gel?

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:41.610
What's this?

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:47.050
Ah!

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.010
It's finally here-nekon!

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:50.410
Congratulations.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.930
You've formed a Dream Team.

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.030
A Dream Team?!

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.520
A new Dream Team has been formed.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:04.840
Everyone, please take the subway to the Dream Theatre.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:29.500
Thank you for waiting.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:32.420
Let's make our way to the Dream Theatre.

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:33.630
Right!

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.740
Now then, please tell me your team name.

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:42.000
Team name?

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.560
We haven't discussed it yet-pri.

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:48.250
In accordance with the Aloma Prophecy,
our team name shall be Dream Alomagedon.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.550
Eh? But I like SoLaMagedon.

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.970
SoLaMagedon?! Hold up a sec-pri!

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:56.470
If we use that, my name wouldn't even be in it any more!

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:58.660
What do you think about "Mirelle with SoLaMagedon"-pri?

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.850
SoLaMagedon Mi is good enough.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:01.620
Wha?!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.510
SoLaMagedon Mi... sounds wonderful.

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:06.090
For real?!

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:10.670
All right, SoLaMagedon Mi, we've arrived at the Dream Gate.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.690
Hold on, Mega-nii!

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:20.810
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:23.230
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:27.190
The Dream Team SoLaMagedon Mi has been formed.

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:36.850
Coord Change Start!

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:45.590
As the party's guest of honour,
a big cake fits Aloma-chan perfectly.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:48.420
Lucky Surprise Birthday Coord!

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:49.890
Devi!

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:54.920
And to liven up PriPara's birthday party,

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.930
Poppin' Clown Coord.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:59.760
Exciting Surprise Party Coord!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:02.100
Gel!

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:08.270
And to announce the beginning of the party, just like a party popper, a full party costume.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.020
Smiling Surprise Party Coord.

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:12.240
Pri.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:17.890
Congrats!

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:21.310
You can do it!

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:24.190
We've been waiting for this!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:26.190
Good luck!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.710
Congrats!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:32.680
Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:43.360
Airy Change!

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:46.910
Cyalume Airy!

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.720
Devi!

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:52.920
Gel!

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:54.320
Pri!

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:12.940
Aloma, happy birthday-nano!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:17.200
Today we celebrate my 660,012th birthday.

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:23.770
Exciting Birthday Party!

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:33.370
Yeah!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.270
Dream Theatre concerts are the best!

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:40.760
This was the most exciting thing in all of the 660,012 years I've lived!

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:41.840
Well done.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:43.800
That was beautiful.

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:45.480
Not bad...

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:46.760
But completely unfair!

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:51.730
Girls, that was a wonderful surprise concert.

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:53.190
But...

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:58.520
...the charm's light has faded.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.500
Yes.

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:02.410
Once you've done your Dream Theatre Concert,

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:04.490
the charm resets your team members.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:05.720
Eh?!

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:07.450
What do you mean?!

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:13.230
Since the system wants to see everyone's potential, you aren't bound to one team.

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:14.410
Oh.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.920
To be honest, I want to see it too.

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:19.840
I want to do it again!

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.760
I'm doing it next!

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:26.650
I'm a little relieved that SoLaMagedon Mi got reset-pri.

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:31.310
Happy birthday!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.200
That was a wonderful concert!

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:07.430
Neko-neesan-usa.

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:08.780
What-nekon?

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:14.740
I have a super cute little sister who is the apple of my ear-usa.

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:18.370
I want to be a cool older brother to my little sister.

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:19.750
Wonderful.

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:22.040
I could fall for you-nekon.

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:23.210
Really-usa?!

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:26.000
Your face is unseemly-nekon.

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:28.260
Where'd that cool older brother go-nekon?

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:30.640
Next time:

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:31.990
This Is My Little Sister.

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:33.320
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:34.760
Let's go PriPara!
